	(descr "Infineon PG-TSDSON-8, 3.3x3.3mm body, 0.65mm pitch. Land pattern from BSZ42DN25NS3G datasheet rev 2.4 page 8 (F1=3.80 F2=2.29 F3=0.31 F6=0.80 F7=2.36). Pads numbered per the package: 1,2,3=Source, 4=Gate, 5=Drain (pins 5-8 + exposed pad merged). Drop-in for Transistor_FET:DMN3008SFG. Package pin function is the industry 3.3x3.3 power-SON standard, confirmed against ST PowerFLAT 3.3x3.3 HV which states D(5,6,7,8) G(4) S(1,2,3).")
